      "credentials": {
        "founderHeading": "Otherness is run by Joel Derksen",
        "biography": "Joel completed his formal studies and launched his design career in Canada, working with boutique clients and agencies across the country. He then left for Europe, working for premium brands like Acura, Salomon and Bacardi, while nurturing his own smaller clients.\n\nHe settled in Rotterdam in 2022 and founded Otherness to offer his systematic “no stones unturned” approach to problem solving to start-ups, scale-ups and brands that aren’t like everyone else. He is involved in every project from pre-conception through to launch.\n\nHis passion for design keeps him learning, taking summer classes and residences around the world in the topics of fashion, art direction, and concept development. He has had solo and group shows of his artistic work in London, Rotterdam and Seoul.\n\nVisually restless, Joel believes that strategy and artful execution are not opposites, and is always interested in creating new and surprising connections instead of revisiting familiar territory.\n\nJoel is co-founder of Nor, a digital co-operative commons dedicated to the discussion and critique of the material culture of Canada.",
